                    <th class="px-4 py-4 font-bold text-gray-600 text-sm">Size</th>
                    <th class="px-4 py-4 font-bold text-gray-600 text-sm">What It Looks Like</th>
                    <th class="px-4 py-4 font-bold text-gray-600 text-sm">How It Behaves</th>
                    <th class="px-4 py-4 font-bold text-gray-600 text-sm">Where It Breeds</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr class="bg-white border-b border-gray-100">
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Fungus gnat</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">1/16 to 1/8 in</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Dark, delicate, mosquito-like, long legs and antennae</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Weak, slow flight; walks on soil and windows</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Moist potting mix and damp organic matter</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-100">
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Drain fly</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">About 0.1 in</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Fuzzy gray-brown, moth-like, wings held roof-like over the body</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Rests on walls; short hops and flights</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Slimy film inside drains, overflows and drip pans</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr class="bg-white border-b border-gray-100">
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Phorid fly</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">1/64 to 1/4 in</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Small, dark, distinctly humpbacked</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Runs in quick bursts more than it flies</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Decaying organic matter, including broken sewer lines</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-100">
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Fruit fly</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">About 1/8 in</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Tan to brown body, usually red eyes</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Hovers around produce and trash</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Fermenting fruit, recycling, sticky residue</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr class="bg-white border-b border-gray-100">
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Flying ant</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Varies by species</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Pinched waist, elbowed antennae, front wings longer than hind</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Swarms at windows and lights</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">An ant colony, in or near the house</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-100">
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Termite swarmer</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Varies by species</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Thick waist, straight bead-like antennae, four equal-length wings</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Swarms at windows, sheds wings in piles</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">A termite colony in or near the structure</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr class="bg-white border-b border-gray-100">
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Small flying beetles</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">1/8 to 3/16 in</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Hard shell, wings hidden under wing covers</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Flies to windows and lights</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Pantry goods or wool, pet hair and lint</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-100">
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Biting midges</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Very small</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Tiny gray-black flies; females bite</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Active at dusk, slip through screens</td>
